# argument                             |   type          |  require?   |   default
# ......................................................................................................
input                                  |   string        |  mandatory  |   -
config                                 |   string        |  optional   |  analysis/sbn_pac_numu_dst.xml
use-file-list,no-use-file-list         |   boolean_list  |  optional   |  no-use-file-list
output                                 |   string        |  mandatory  |  valor_caf_dst.root
beam                                   |   string        |  optional   |  BNB_FHC
sample                                 |   string        |  optional   |  ND,NuMuCC,inclusive
off-axis-bins                          |   double_vector |  optional   |  0.0,180.0
oscillation                            |   string        |  optional   |  numu-disappearance
is-data,no-is-data                     |   boolean_list  |  optional   |  no-is-data
write-systematics,no-write-systematics |   boolean_list  |  optional   |  no-write-systematics
systematics-output                     |   string        |  optional   |  valor_caf_systematics.h5
max-n-events                           |   integer       |  optional   |  -1
mesg-thresholds                        |   string        |  optional   |  verbosity.xml